<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="ja"><head><metadata><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="1323303094"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1517969635"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="FAKE LOVE (Japanese Version)"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="BTS (防弹少年团)"/><amll:meta key="album" value="FAKE LOVE / Airplane pt.2"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="03:55.579"><div begin="00:00.420" end="03:54.898"><p begin="00:00.420" end="00:05.535" itunes:key="L14997">君の為なら悲しくても笑顔でいれた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">若是为了你</span></p><p begin="00:06.624" end="00:11.694" itunes:key="L14998">君の為なら痛みさえも見せずにいれた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">若是为了你</span></p><p begin="00:12.829" end="00:15.775" itunes:key="L14999">愛で　皆　満たされるように<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">希望依靠爱情让一切得以圆满</span></p><p begin="00:15.926" end="00:18.817" itunes:key="L15000">僕の弱さを隠すように<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">希望能够藏起我的种种弱点</span></p><p begin="00:19.072" end="00:21.149" itunes:key="L15001">叶わない夢の中<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在无法实现的梦境中</span></p><p begin="00:21.159" end="00:24.238" itunes:key="L15002">咲かない花育てた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">种下了无法绽放的花</span></p><p begin="00:24.622" end="00:25.713" itunes:key="L15003">I'm so sick of this<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我已经厌倦了这种</span></p><p begin="00:25.723" end="00:29.907" itunes:key="L15004">Fake love, fake love, fake love<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">虚假的爱</span></p><p begin="00:30.776" end="00:31.912" itunes:key="L15005">I'm so sorry but it's<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我很抱歉 但这是</span></p><p begin="00:31.922" end="00:36.262" itunes:key="L15006">Fake love, fake love, fake love<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">虚假的爱</span></p><p begin="00:37.129" end="00:40.613" itunes:key="L15007">I wanna be a good man just for you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我只想做一个对你来说完美的人</span></p><p begin="00:40.623" end="00:43.664" itunes:key="L15008">世界だって just for you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">愿意为你付出一切</span></p><p begin="00:43.704" end="00:46.810" itunes:key="L15009">全部変えて just for you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">愿意为你改变所有</span></p><p begin="00:46.820" end="00:50.404" itunes:key="L15010">Now I dunno me, who are you?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">现在我已经不知道自己是谁</span></p><p begin="00:50.521" end="00:53.341" itunes:key="L15011">二人の root 君はもういない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你我相识的地方 不再有你身影</span></p><p begin="00:53.675" end="00:56.417" itunes:key="L15012">過ごした route 覚えてもない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一起走过的地方 也不再有记忆</span></p><p begin="00:56.779" end="00:59.480" itunes:key="L15013">今じゃもう　自分でも全て見失い<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">现在连自己是谁 都快要迷失</span></p><p begin="00:59.870" end="01:02.317" itunes:key="L15014">問いかける　鏡に写る君は誰だ？<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">对着镜中的自己发问 你是谁</span></p><p begin="01:02.327" end="01:07.284" itunes:key="L15015">君の為なら悲しくても笑顔でいれた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">若是为了你</span></p><p begin="01:08.555" end="01:13.432" itunes:key="L15016">君の為なら痛みさえも見せずにいれた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">若是为了你</span></p><p begin="01:14.772" end="01:17.707" itunes:key="L15017">愛で　皆　満たされるように<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">希望依靠爱情让一切得以圆满</span></p><p begin="01:17.828" end="01:20.812" itunes:key="L15018">僕の弱さを隠すように<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">希望能够藏起我的种种弱点</span></p><p begin="01:20.950" end="01:23.062" itunes:key="L15019">叶わない夢の中<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在无法实现的梦境中</span></p><p begin="01:23.072" end="01:26.203" itunes:key="L15020">咲かない花育てた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">种下了无法绽放的花</span></p><p begin="01:26.912" end="01:29.705" itunes:key="L15021">Love you so bad, love you so bad<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我是如此爱你</span></p><p begin="01:30.022" end="01:32.790" itunes:key="L15022">君の為　偽る嘘で<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">为了你编造着违心的谎言</span></p><p begin="01:33.167" end="01:35.928" itunes:key="L15023">Love, it's so mad, love, it's so mad<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">爱到如痴如醉</span></p><p begin="01:36.223" end="01:39.030" itunes:key="L15024">自分を君の色に染める<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我心甘情愿染上你的色彩</span></p><p begin="01:39.374" end="01:42.107" itunes:key="L15025">Love you so bad, love you so bad<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我是如此爱你</span></p><p begin="01:42.424" end="01:45.213" itunes:key="L15026">君の為　偽る嘘で<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">为了你编造着违心的谎言</span></p><p begin="01:45.578" end="01:48.365" itunes:key="L15027">Love, it's so mad, love, it's so mad<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">爱到如痴如醉</span></p><p begin="01:48.578" end="01:51.315" itunes:key="L15028">自分を君の色に染める<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我心甘情愿染上你的色彩</span></p><p begin="01:51.325" end="01:52.457" itunes:key="L15029">I'm so sick of this<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我已经厌倦了这</span></p><p begin="01:52.467" end="01:56.716" itunes:key="L15030">Fake love, fake love, fake love<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">虚假的爱</span></p><p begin="01:57.522" end="01:58.610" itunes:key="L15031">I'm so sorry but it's<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我很抱歉 但这是</span></p><p begin="01:58.620" end="02:02.960" itunes:key="L15032">Fake love, fake love, fake love<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">虚假的爱</span></p><p begin="02:05.276" end="02:08.026" itunes:key="L15033">Why you sad? I don't know 何も<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我不知道你为何而难过</span></p><p begin="02:08.409" end="02:11.120" itunes:key="L15034">今は　聞きたい　愛を<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">现在我 好想听你说爱我</span></p><p begin="02:11.526" end="02:14.246" itunes:key="L15035">前の  自分はいないもう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">从前那个我已不存在</span></p><p begin="02:14.625" end="02:17.369" itunes:key="L15036">君の理解すらないもう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">甚至连你都无法理解</span></p><p begin="02:17.726" end="02:20.402" itunes:key="L15037">純粋なままの君を求めても<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就算渴求着纯粹如初的你</span></p><p begin="02:20.800" end="02:23.490" itunes:key="L15038">すれ違いすでに戻れない元へと<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">终还是会错过回不到当初</span></p><p begin="02:23.875" end="02:26.631" itunes:key="L15039">なぜなのか　もうわからない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这一切是为了什么 我不知道</span></p><p begin="02:26.974" end="02:30.066" itunes:key="L15040">愛なのかすらも It's all fake love<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">甚至质疑这爱情都是虚假的</span></p><p begin="02:30.076" end="02:34.588" itunes:key="L15041">(Woo) I dunno, I dunno, I dunno why<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我也不知道为什么</span></p><p begin="02:36.223" end="02:40.698" itunes:key="L15042">(Woo) 僕も僕が見えなくて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">连我自己也看不清楚自己</span></p><p begin="02:42.424" end="02:46.712" itunes:key="L15043">(Woo) I just know, I just know, I just know why<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我只知道为何</span></p><p begin="02:47.626" end="02:52.874" itunes:key="L15044">'Cause it's all fake love, fake love, fake love<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只因一切都是虚假的爱</span></p><p begin="02:53.672" end="02:56.438" itunes:key="L15045">Love you so bad, love you so bad<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我是如此爱你</span></p><p begin="02:56.728" end="02:59.556" itunes:key="L15046">君の為　偽る嘘で<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">为了你编造着违心的谎言</span></p><p begin="02:59.879" end="03:02.861" itunes:key="L15047">Love, it's so mad, love, it's so mad<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">爱到如痴如醉</span></p><p begin="03:02.901" end="03:05.931" itunes:key="L15048">自分を君の色に染める<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我心甘情愿染上你的色彩</span></p><p begin="03:06.026" end="03:08.940" itunes:key="L15049">Love you so bad, love you so bad<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我是如此爱你</span></p><p begin="03:09.073" end="03:12.031" itunes:key="L15050">君の為　偽る嘘で<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">为了你编造着违心的谎言</span></p><p begin="03:12.213" end="03:15.319" itunes:key="L15051">Love, it's so mad, love, it's so mad<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">爱到如痴如醉</span></p><p begin="03:15.323" end="03:18.059" itunes:key="L15052">自分を君の色に染める<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我心甘情愿染上你的色彩</span></p><p begin="03:18.069" end="03:19.161" itunes:key="L15053">I'm so sick of this<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我已经厌倦了这种</span></p><p begin="03:19.171" end="03:23.505" itunes:key="L15054">Fake love, fake love, fake love<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">虚假的爱</span></p><p begin="03:24.220" end="03:25.363" itunes:key="L15055">I'm so sorry but it's<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我很抱歉 但这是</span></p><p begin="03:25.373" end="03:29.673" itunes:key="L15056">Fake love, fake love, fake love<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">虚假的爱</span></p><p begin="03:30.925" end="03:36.284" itunes:key="L15057">君の為なら悲しくても笑顔でいれた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">若是为了你</span></p><p begin="03:37.174" end="03:42.162" itunes:key="L15058">君の為なら痛みさえも見せずにいれた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">若是为了你</span></p><p begin="03:43.371" end="03:46.452" itunes:key="L15059">愛で　皆　満たされるように<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">希望依靠爱情让一切得以圆满</span></p><p begin="03:46.462" end="03:49.613" itunes:key="L15060">僕の弱さを隠すように<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">希望能够藏起我的种种弱点</span></p><p begin="03:49.623" end="03:51.719" itunes:key="L15061">叶わない夢の中<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在无法实现的梦境中</span></p><p begin="03:51.729" end="03:54.898" itunes:key="L15062">咲かない花育てた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">种下了无法绽放的花</span></p></div></body></tt>